      <div style="background:#000;padding:2rem;"><h3 style="font-size:1rem;font-weight:500;color:#fff;margin-bottom:0.75rem;"><a href="/products/#knit-garments" style="color:#fff;text-decoration:none;">Hoodies</a></h3><p style="color:#FFFFFF;font-size:0.85rem;line-height:1.6;margin-bottom:1rem;">Pullover and zip hoodies, fleece, French terry.</p><a href="/products/#knit-garments" style="font-size:0.8rem;color:#e00;text-decoration:none;">Learn more →</a></div>
      <div style="background:#000;padding:2rem;"><h3 style="font-size:1rem;font-weight:500;color:#fff;margin-bottom:0.75rem;"><a href="/products/#knit-garments" style="color:#fff;text-decoration:none;">Polo Shirts</a></h3><p style="color:#FFFFFF;font-size:0.85rem;line-height:1.6;margin-bottom:1rem;">Classic pique, performance polos.</p><a href="/products/#knit-garments" style="font-size:0.8rem;color:#e00;text-decoration:none;">Learn more →</a></div>
      <div style="background:#000;padding:2rem;"><h3 style="font-size:1rem;font-weight:500;color:#fff;margin-bottom:0.75rem;"><a href="/products/#knit-garments" style="color:#fff;text-decoration:none;">Joggers</a></h3><p style="color:#FFFFFF;font-size:0.85rem;line-height:1.6;margin-bottom:1rem;">Fleece joggers, track pants, athletic bottoms.</p><a href="/products/#knit-garments" style="font-size:0.8rem;color:#e00;text-decoration:none;">Learn more →</a></div>
      <div style="background:#000;padding:2rem;"><h3 style="font-size:1rem;font-weight:500;color:#fff;margin-bottom:0.75rem;">Shorts</h3><p style="color:#FFFFFF;font-size:0.85rem;line-height:1.6;margin-bottom:1rem;">Casual shorts, athletic shorts, denim shorts.</p></div>
      <div style="background:#000;padding:2rem;"><h3 style="font-size:1rem;font-weight:500;color:#fff;margin-bottom:0.75rem;">Cargo Pants</h3><p style="color:#FFFFFF;font-size:0.85rem;line-height:1.6;margin-bottom:1rem;">Tactical cargo pants, multi-pocket pants.</p></div>
      <div style="background:#000;padding:2rem;"><h3 style="font-size:1rem;font-weight:500;color:#fff;margin-bottom:0.75rem;">Tank Tops</h3><p style="color:#FFFFFF;font-size:0.85rem;line-height:1.6;margin-bottom:1rem;">Basic tanks, muscle tanks, ribbed tanks.</p></div>
      <div style="background:#000;padding:2rem;"><h3 style="font-size:1rem;font-weight:500;color:#fff;margin-bottom:0.75rem;">Loungewear</h3><p style="color:#FFFFFF;font-size:0.85rem;line-height:1.6;margin-bottom:1rem;">Comfortable home wear, sleepwear sets.</p></div>
      <div style="background:#000;padding:2rem;"><h3 style="font-size:1rem;font-weight:500;color:#fff;margin-bottom:0.75rem;">Dresses</h3><p style="color:#FFFFFF;font-size:0.85rem;line-height:1.6;margin-bottom:1rem;">Casual dresses, evening dresses.</p></div>
