      <div style="background:#000;padding:2rem;"><h3 style="font-size:1rem;font-weight:500;color:#fff;margin-bottom:0.75rem;"><a href="/products/#woven-garments" style="color:#fff;text-decoration:none;">Jackets</a></h3><p style="color:#FFFFFF;font-size:0.85rem;line-height:1.6;margin-bottom:1rem;">Light jackets, bombers, windbreakers.</p><a href="/products/#woven-garments" style="font-size:0.8rem;color:#e00;text-decoration:none;">Learn more →</a></div>
      <div style="background:#000;padding:2rem;"><h3 style="font-size:1rem;font-weight:500;color:#fff;margin-bottom:0.75rem;"><a href="/products/#woven-garments" style="color:#fff;text-decoration:none;">Blazers</a></h3><p style="color:#FFFFFF;font-size:0.85rem;line-height:1.6;margin-bottom:1rem;">Formal blazers, suit jackets, tailored blazers.</p><a href="/products/#woven-garments" style="font-size:0.8rem;color:#e00;text-decoration:none;">Learn more →</a></div>
      <div style="background:#000;padding:2rem;"><h3 style="font-size:1rem;font-weight:500;color:#fff;margin-bottom:0.75rem;">Sweaters</h3><p style="color:#FFFFFF;font-size:0.85rem;line-height:1.6;margin-bottom:1rem;">Knit sweaters, cardigans, pullovers.</p></div>
